# Image Assets

Place your images here:

- profile.jpg - Your professional headshot (recommended: 600x600px, square)
- og-image.jpg - Open Graph image for social media sharing (recommended: 1200x630px)
- apple-touch-icon.png - iOS home screen icon (180x180px)

Note: The profile image on the home page will display a placeholder gradient if profile.jpg is not found.
